From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Leonid <leonidy.1985@yandex.ru>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 07:05:00 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] drm/panel: it6112: move 44 more vblank lines into the back
 porch

The first frame-shift fix moved 212 lines from the front porch into the
back porch, but a ~2% black band remained on the portrait top edge (the
left edge in landscape).  Move another 44 lines there.

The vblank total grows from 2432 to 2476 lines; the pixel clock is
unchanged, so the refresh rate becomes 58.93 Hz instead of 60 Hz.
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-it6112-boe-tv110xum-lb2.c | 14 +++++++-------
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+), 7 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-it6112-boe-tv110xum-lb2.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-it6112-boe-tv110xum-lb2.c
index e23dc35..2c635b3 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-it6112-boe-tv110xum-lb2.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-it6112-boe-tv110xum-lb2.c
@@ -903,15 +903,15 @@ static const struct drm_display_mode boe_tv110xum_lb2_mode = {
 	.htotal = 1600 + 14 + 44 + 44,
 	.vdisplay = 2176,
 	/*
-	 * EXPERIMENT: the image comes out shifted towards the start of the
-	 * frame - a ~10% black band on the portrait top edge, content cut off
-	 * on the opposite edge - so move ~212 lines from the front porch into
-	 * the back porch.  The vblank total (and the pixel clock) is unchanged,
-	 * so this only moves the active window inside the frame.
+	 * The panel shows the frame early: after moving 212 lines from the
+	 * front porch into the back porch a ~2% black band remained on the
+	 * portrait top edge, so move another 44 lines there.  The vblank
+	 * total grows by 44 lines; the pixel clock is unchanged, giving
+	 * 58.93 Hz instead of 60 Hz.
 	 */
 	.vsync_start = 2176 + 8,
-	.vsync_end = 2176 + 8 + 240,
-	.vtotal = 2176 + 8 + 240 + 8,
+	.vsync_end = 2176 + 8 + 284,
+	.vtotal = 2176 + 8 + 284 + 8,
 	.width_mm = 166,
 	.height_mm = 226,
 };
-- 
2.54.0

